<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Permission on InterP Blog</title><link>https://interp.blog/tags/permission/</link><description>Recent content in Permission on InterP Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko-kr</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 18 Mar 2019 04:50:30 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://interp.blog/tags/permission/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Windows SSH RSA Key 문제 해결</title><link>https://interp.blog/windows-ssh-rsa-key-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 Mar 2019 04:50:30 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://interp.blog/windows-ssh-rsa-key-%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://interp.blog/images/featured/ssh-rsa.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Windows SSH RSA Key 문제 해결" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Windows Server 2016에서 OpenSSH 를 설치하고, cmd 에서 다음과 같이 RSA 키를 생성한다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$ ssh-keygen -t rsa
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;그러고 Public Key 를 SSH Server 에 위치한 authorized_keys 파일에 추가하고 접속을 시도하면?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;@ WARNING: UNPROTECTED PRIVATE KEY FILE! @
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Permissions &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;C:\\Users\\interp/.ssh/id_rsa&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; are too open.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;It is required that your private key files are NOT accessible by others.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;This private key will be ignored.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Load key &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\\Users\\interp/.ssh/id_rsa&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: bad permissions
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;interp@192.168.0.30&lt;span class="err"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;s password:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;오잉? 내 파일이 맞는데 이게 뭘까. Private Key 파일에 마우스 우클릭을 하고 봤더니 여러 사용자가 읽기 권한으로 걸려 있는 것을 확인할 수 있었다. 이건 아니다… 등록된 사용자를 전부 지우고 현재 사용자에게 모든 권한을 준 다음에, 확인을 눌러 권한 변경을 해 준다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="euLmFtS"&gt;
 &lt;img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1518 " src="https://interp.blog/uploads/2019/06/img_5d11dcea1b41a.png" alt="" srcset="https://interp.blog/uploads/2019/06/img_5d11dcea1b41a.png 421w, https://interp.blog/uploads/2019/06/img_5d11dcea1b41a-218x300.png 218w" sizes="(max-width: 421px) 100vw, 421px" /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lsquo;편집&amp;rsquo; 에 가서 등록된 사용자를 지우려고 하면, 상속으로 인해 지울 수 없다는 괴상한 에러가 뜰 것이다. 그러니까 위 화면에서 &amp;lsquo;고급&amp;rsquo; 으로 간 다음, 아래 캡처에 있는 &amp;lsquo;상속 사용 안 함&amp;rsquo; 을 클릭하면 자동으로 지워진다. 그 다음 시도하면, 잘 된다!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id="bzFxOJb"&gt;
 &lt;img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1519 " src="https://interp.blog/uploads/2019/06/img_5d11dd707fe99.png" alt="" srcset="https://interp.blog/uploads/2019/06/img_5d11dd707fe99.png 293w, https://interp.blog/uploads/2019/06/img_5d11dd707fe99-216x300.png 216w" sizes="(max-width: 293px) 100vw, 293px" /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;출처 : https://superuser.com/questions/1296024/windows-ssh-permissions-for-private-key-are-too-open&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>